# ANIM-BS1D-SPEED: the Mannequin_Locomotion state machine's Locomotion state is a Blend Space 1D on Speed (cm/s)
# (Walk_Loop sample at 150, Jog_Fwd_Loop sample at 600). ANIM-PROOF 11-26 found the axis never read the
# animator's Speed parameter (AnimGraph.hpp:100, Animator.hpp:127); the fix moves parameter values onto the
# Animator (SetGraphParameter) so a state's blend-space axis reads them the same as a pose-graph pin.
# ProofB (x 150, z -300) runs the locomotion graph, evaluated in Edit mode (Animation.UpdateAnimationInEditor).
Проект Projects/Desert/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/PawnNoController_Demo.desce
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано spawn Characters/Mannequin/Mannequin.skmesh 150,0,-300 --id 7700000000000000002
Дано set 7700000000000000002 Tag.Tag ProofB
Дано set 7700000000000000002 Animation.UpdateAnimationInEditor true
Дано set 7700000000000000002 Animation.Graph "\"assets:Characters/Mannequin/Mannequin_Locomotion.danimgraph\""
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 75,110,0
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-0.15,-1
# [anim_bs1d_walk] Speed 150 sits exactly on the Walk_Loop sample.
Когда lua "World.find('ProofB'):setAnimParam('Speed', 150.0)"
Когда 40 frames render
Тогда-вид anim_bs1d_walk ProofB plays the walk sample (Walk_Loop): a walking stride, not standing idle and not the longer running stride
# [anim_bs1d_run] Speed 600 sits exactly on the Jog_Fwd_Loop sample.
Когда lua "World.find('ProofB'):setAnimParam('Speed', 600.0)"
Когда 40 frames render
Тогда-вид anim_bs1d_run ProofB plays the run sample (Jog_Fwd_Loop): a longer running stride, forward lean, visibly different from anim_bs1d_walk
